@startuml
title UC-12 - Manage Application variables and secrets (design)
autonumber
actor Developer as Dev
boundary "Application Settings UI" as UI
control "Configuration control" as Config
entity "Workload reference lookup" as Refs
database "Revision metadata" as Store
participant "Configuration provider" as Provider

Dev -> UI: Open Settings; select Staging or Production [MS-01]
UI -> Config: List variable and secret keys(application, environment)
Config -> Store: Read names, variable values or secret status
Store --> UI: Both scoped key lists
Dev -> UI: Add/update key value [MS-02]
UI -> Config: Validate and save desired change [MS-03]
Config -> Provider: Write immutable desired revision
Provider --> Config: Revision reference
Config -> Store: Save desired revision reference; keep applied reference
Config -> Refs: Find referencing workloads [MS-04]
Refs --> UI: Affected workload names
UI --> Dev: Pending Preview -> Deploy

alt Rename or delete [VAR-01..VAR-02]
  Dev -> UI: Request rename/delete
  UI -> Refs: Find referencing workloads
  Refs --> UI: Affected workload names
  UI --> Dev: Warning; references are not rewritten
  Dev -> UI: Confirm
  UI -> Config: Save pending rename/delete
  Config -> Provider: Write new desired revision
  Config -> Store: Save desired reference only
end
@enduml
